WEBVTT

00:01.350 --> 00:03.730
I love you, Miss Claire!

00:04.350 --> 00:06.530
<i>I reincarnated into the world 
of an otome game,</i>

00:06.530 --> 00:11.360
<i>where my favorite character is 
the villainess, Claire François.</i>

00:12.690 --> 00:17.050
That cackling laugh, all the nasty deeds 
she does out of pure malice...

00:17.050 --> 00:20.080
Everything about her is right up my alley!

00:21.330 --> 00:24.100
Let's see which of us performs 
better on tomorrow's exams.

00:24.590 --> 00:28.690
If I win, you will leave this academy.

00:29.420 --> 00:33.170
Finally, the results 
of the magic ability exam.

00:36.470 --> 00:38.180
<b>Magic Ability Exam Results</b>

00:39.930 --> 00:43.680
<b>\h1st     Rae Taylor   (Unmeasurable)\h</b>

00:44.160 --> 00:46.250
First place... Rae Taylor?

00:46.250 --> 00:47.690
Unmeasurable?!

00:48.810 --> 00:50.940
What does "unmeasurable" even mean?

00:50.940 --> 00:52.160
And she still placed first?

00:52.160 --> 00:53.650
It wasn't even close, then?

00:53.650 --> 00:56.150
Quiet! Quiet!

00:56.150 --> 01:00.330
Because Rae Taylor's scores were so unique,

00:57.320 --> 01:05.040
<b>Overall Results</b>

00:57.320 --> 01:05.040
<b>1st    Rod Bauer</b>

00:57.320 --> 01:05.040
<b>2nd   Yu Bauer</b>

00:57.320 --> 01:05.040
<b>3rd   Claire François</b>

00:57.320 --> 01:05.040
<b>5th   Misha Jur</b>

00:57.320 --> 01:05.040
<b>10th   Thane Bauer</b>

01:00.330 --> 01:05.040
she has been excluded from the overall 
results as a special exception.

01:05.040 --> 01:06.790
Dismissed!

01:06.790 --> 01:08.540
Rae, you...

01:09.100 --> 01:11.540
What is the meaning of this?

01:11.850 --> 01:15.550
I've never heard of magic 
ability being "unmeasurable"!

01:18.430 --> 01:23.310
Rae, did you miss the target 
on purpose in the magic tool exam?

01:29.600 --> 01:32.900
Miss it on purpose? Why?

01:32.900 --> 01:35.630
I don't know, either.

01:35.630 --> 01:38.490
You missed it and still came in first?

01:38.880 --> 01:42.820
Her score in the basic magic ability exam 
must have been extremely high.

01:42.820 --> 01:45.200
High enough to be 
classified as unmeasurable.

01:45.200 --> 01:46.360
You're not saying...

01:46.870 --> 01:49.750
her aptitude level is higher 
than "exceptional," are you?

01:49.750 --> 01:53.320
Nah, that would break 
the device used to measure it.

01:53.320 --> 01:55.760
Which means there's only one possibility...

01:56.890 --> 02:03.540
Normally, a person can only possess one 
attribute: earth, water, fire, or wind.

02:03.540 --> 02:05.890
But what if she has more than one?

02:07.670 --> 02:12.730
You mean she's one of the incredibly 
rare people who can use two attributes?

02:12.730 --> 02:15.860
Oh, that's just my own 
speculation, of course.

02:15.860 --> 02:19.490
That would make Rae... a dual caster?

02:19.490 --> 02:21.240
<i>Bingo.</i>

02:21.610 --> 02:26.250
<i>The protagonist can use two 
attributes: earth and water.</i>

02:26.250 --> 02:30.800
<i>She's a "dual caster," an incredibly 
rare user of two attributes.</i>

02:31.200 --> 02:35.360
<i>Not only that, but she's "exceptional," 
the highest rank possible, in each.</i>

02:35.360 --> 02:37.090
<i>So the game is designed</i>

02:37.090 --> 02:40.340
<i>so that her magic is declared 
unmeasurable in the first exam event.</i>

02:40.840 --> 02:45.000
<i>And that means this exam 
was rigged in my favor!</i>

02:48.380 --> 02:52.490
Miss Claire, you came in third 
behind Prince Rod and Prince Yu!

02:52.490 --> 02:53.400
That's right.

02:53.400 --> 02:56.870
There's no need to trouble 
yourself over that commoner.

02:57.150 --> 02:59.540
Th-That is true...

02:59.540 --> 03:02.910
Miss Claire!

03:02.910 --> 03:06.160
Please don't make noises 
as if you just saw a ghost.

03:06.160 --> 03:09.040
Well, don't show up out 
of nowhere like that, then!

03:09.560 --> 03:11.050
What do you want?

03:11.050 --> 03:13.060
Since you were excluded from 
the overall exam results,

03:13.060 --> 03:15.050
that means our contest is off, does it not?

03:15.050 --> 03:17.190
What are you talking about, Miss Claire?

03:17.190 --> 03:18.920
The agreement was "if you don't win."

03:19.610 --> 03:20.550
What?

03:21.090 --> 03:24.040
I said, wasn't this the promise we made?

03:24.960 --> 03:30.730
But if you don't win, you have 
to do one thing I ask of you.

03:30.730 --> 03:33.480
Since there was no winner in the contest,

03:33.480 --> 03:37.980
that means you failed 
to defeat me, doesn't it?

03:39.670 --> 03:40.930
How cowardly!

03:40.930 --> 03:42.990
Yep! And I knew it would end that way!

03:42.990 --> 03:45.410
That obviously nullifies the result!

03:45.410 --> 03:47.490
You blatantly deceived me!

03:47.490 --> 03:50.070
What? You're going back on your word?

03:50.070 --> 03:52.500
But we swore to God and everything...

03:54.350 --> 03:58.180
<i>In this kingdom, swearing to God 
is an act of extreme significance.</i>

03:58.180 --> 04:01.270
<i>Any who break such a vow are held in 
contempt, regardless or social status.</i>

04:02.330 --> 04:04.130
What is your demand?

04:04.130 --> 04:06.150
So you <i>will</i> do what I ask?

04:06.150 --> 04:08.510
That's my Miss Claire! I love you!

04:09.030 --> 04:11.140
Just say it already!

04:12.640 --> 04:14.140
All right, then...

04:14.770 --> 04:16.500
Don't give up.

04:17.850 --> 04:19.020
Huh?

04:19.510 --> 04:22.420
No matter how difficult 
or painful things may get,

04:22.420 --> 04:25.150
never give up until the very end.

04:25.470 --> 04:28.780
W-Wait... What are you talking about?

04:28.780 --> 04:30.660
That's all you want me to do?

04:30.660 --> 04:31.880
Yes.

04:32.530 --> 04:34.910
That's what I want.

04:37.150 --> 04:39.720
I thought you'd ask for 
something more unreasonable.

04:39.720 --> 04:40.940
You'd prefer that?!

04:40.940 --> 04:44.340
I can still change my request to one 
that's more faithful to my desires!

04:44.340 --> 04:45.800
That's quite all right!

04:47.030 --> 04:48.830
Very well, then.

04:50.650 --> 04:54.560
I swear to God that I will never give up.

04:54.560 --> 04:57.390
No matter what happens, 
I will not abandon hope.

04:57.390 --> 05:00.390
I swear to continue fighting 
until the very end.

05:04.410 --> 05:06.820
Is that really all you want?

05:06.820 --> 05:09.570
That's all, Miss Claire.

05:11.580 --> 05:13.100
I won't lose next time.

05:16.060 --> 05:17.250
Miss Claire!

05:17.650 --> 05:18.960
What now?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.210
I love you!

05:21.460 --> 05:23.960
Well, I utterly despise you!

06:53.970 --> 06:58.980
<b>Episode 2</b>

06:53.970 --> 06:58.980
<b>A Maid's Job Is a Labor of Love</b>

07:00.270 --> 07:01.480
Head Maid...

07:01.850 --> 07:02.980
Yes?

07:02.980 --> 07:07.720
I was told that we would be interviewing 
potential future maids today...

07:07.720 --> 07:08.740
Yes.

07:08.740 --> 07:11.910
So why is this girl here?!

07:11.910 --> 07:16.160
I went through the proper procedures 
and made it to the final interview!

07:16.630 --> 07:20.000
I'm exempt from tuition fees 
thanks to the scholarship program,

07:20.000 --> 07:23.350
but I still need money for things, you know?

07:23.350 --> 07:26.270
If I'm your maid, I can make some money,

07:26.270 --> 07:29.550
and it gives me a reason to be 
near you all the time! It's win-win!

07:29.890 --> 07:31.550
"Win-win"...

07:31.550 --> 07:34.180
I wouldn't benefit from that at all!

07:34.180 --> 07:35.150
Rejected!

07:35.150 --> 07:36.190
Your application is rejected!

07:36.190 --> 07:39.310
Are you absolutely sure 
about this, Miss Claire?

07:39.950 --> 07:42.600
She's superior to the 
other candidates by far.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.360
She's perfect for the job.

07:44.760 --> 07:47.410
She seems to have a deep 
sense of loyalty, as well.

07:47.410 --> 07:48.820
You're wrong about that.

07:49.290 --> 07:51.190
It's not loyalty.

07:51.190 --> 07:53.320
Yes... What I have is...

07:53.320 --> 07:54.700
love!

07:56.830 --> 07:58.320
"Love"...

07:58.320 --> 08:01.710
I can't keep a maid 
who says things like that!

08:02.070 --> 08:04.210
What's all the noise in here?

08:07.710 --> 08:12.480
Claire's father, Dole, 
is the kingdom's minister of finance.

08:08.010 --> 08:13.720
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

08:08.010 --> 08:13.720
<b>Dole François</b>

08:12.480 --> 08:15.990
He's number three in line behind 
the king and the prime minister.

08:17.350 --> 08:19.730
My apologies, sir.

08:19.730 --> 08:23.230
We were selecting a maid to 
attend on Miss Claire at school,

08:23.230 --> 08:26.190
and it seems she did not like this choice.

08:26.190 --> 08:28.730
There are too many problems 
with her personality.

08:28.730 --> 08:31.690
She's always mocking me at school.

08:31.690 --> 08:32.740
Oh?

08:32.740 --> 08:37.330
If the head maid has chosen her, 
I'm sure there's no issue with her abilities.

08:37.740 --> 08:42.470
But if Claire doesn't want her, 
then we shouldn't hire her.

08:42.470 --> 08:44.140
Father!

08:44.140 --> 08:47.570
There are many others 
suited to be your maid.

08:47.570 --> 08:48.930
Your Grace.

08:48.930 --> 08:52.670
I hope you will pardon my insolence, 
but I would like to speak.

08:53.750 --> 08:56.650
It appears Claire's judgment was correct.

08:56.650 --> 09:00.130
What might a mere commoner 
have to say to me?

09:00.130 --> 09:01.690
Such impudence will not be toler—

09:00.850 --> 09:02.850
Irvine Manuel.

09:07.940 --> 09:09.660
And just who is that?

09:09.660 --> 09:11.440
March the third.

09:12.040 --> 09:13.950
Five hundred thousand gold.

09:16.080 --> 09:17.230
Father?

09:17.230 --> 09:20.440
Would you two mind leaving me 
alone with her for a moment?

09:21.160 --> 09:22.460
I will assign a guar—

09:22.460 --> 09:24.210
That is an order.

09:24.630 --> 09:26.040
Father...

09:26.040 --> 09:28.010
Must I leave, too?

09:28.010 --> 09:29.850
I'm sorry, Claire.

09:31.280 --> 09:36.220
Just bear with me for now. 
There's something I must make sure of.

09:37.900 --> 09:38.840
All right.

09:42.620 --> 09:43.730
Now...

09:44.110 --> 09:45.800
Who are you?

09:47.500 --> 09:49.290
How much do you know?

09:59.740 --> 10:01.020
Father!

10:01.730 --> 10:02.840
Claire.

10:03.870 --> 10:06.580
You will accept this girl as your maid.

10:06.580 --> 10:07.790
Huh?!

10:08.990 --> 10:11.930
But why?! You were against it 
just moments a—

10:11.930 --> 10:14.120
She can be trusted.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.090
She is fit to be your maid.

10:16.090 --> 10:19.100
What did you say to my father?!

10:19.100 --> 10:23.100
Nothing special! Only my 
love for you, if anything!

10:24.350 --> 10:25.230
W...

10:25.230 --> 10:27.400
Would you please be serious?!

10:27.400 --> 10:29.290
That goes for you as well, Father!

10:29.290 --> 10:32.280
I can't agree to keep 
this peasant by my side!

10:32.280 --> 10:33.650
Claire.

10:34.800 --> 10:37.940
It's easy to keep someone meek 
and submissive at your side.

10:37.940 --> 10:42.780
But a daughter of François must prove 
she can hold a restive horse's reins.

10:45.690 --> 10:48.920
You insist that I hire her, no matter what?

10:48.920 --> 10:49.880
Yes.

10:52.760 --> 10:54.290
Very well.

10:56.510 --> 10:57.760
You!

10:57.760 --> 11:02.270
If you're going to be my maid, 
you must abide by everything I say!

11:02.270 --> 11:03.260
Be prepared!

11:03.260 --> 11:04.770
Of course!

11:04.770 --> 11:06.850
Then you will begin tomorrow.

11:06.850 --> 11:12.270
Leave it to me! I'll serve her with 
all my heart until the end of my life!

11:12.270 --> 11:15.400
Y-You don't have to be <i>that</i> devoted...

11:17.400 --> 11:20.460
I love you, Miss Claire!

11:20.870 --> 11:22.850
Why is this happening to me?

11:35.500 --> 11:37.880
No! I just can't endure this!

11:37.880 --> 11:41.260
I know I'm not just imagining 
that wicked look in your eyes!

11:42.130 --> 11:44.040
My apologies.

11:44.040 --> 11:46.890
Let me gaze just a bit longer, 
and I'll be done!

11:46.890 --> 11:48.890
No more! I'm telling you to stop!

11:48.890 --> 11:51.900
Miss Claire! Just a little more!

11:49.600 --> 11:51.900
What do you mean by "gaze," anyway?!

11:52.390 --> 11:54.610
Come now, Rae.

11:54.610 --> 11:57.540
You mustn't tease Miss Claire so much.

11:57.540 --> 11:59.490
Sorry.

11:59.490 --> 12:02.650
Miss Claire just looked so beautiful.

12:02.650 --> 12:04.620
I'm sick of your flattery!

12:04.950 --> 12:09.660
Honestly... Nothing good will come of 
entrusting anything to this commoner.

12:09.660 --> 12:11.970
I'll just have Lene assist me 
with changing clothes as always.

12:11.970 --> 12:13.600
Now, Miss Claire,

12:13.600 --> 12:16.690
if you don't let Rae gain experience, 
you'll only have more trouble.

12:16.690 --> 12:20.740
There may be times when I am 
sick and unable to care for you.

12:20.740 --> 12:23.760
Well... that may be true, but...

12:24.120 --> 12:26.180
<i>This is Lene Aurousseau.</i>

12:24.930 --> 12:30.770
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

12:24.930 --> 12:30.770
<b>Lene Aurousseau</b>

12:26.180 --> 12:30.170
<i>She's a senior maid who's been 
serving Miss Claire since childhood.</i>

12:30.770 --> 12:33.240
<i>She's from one of the wealthiest 
merchant companies in the kingdom,</i>

12:33.240 --> 12:34.740
<i>the Aurousseau Company.</i>

12:34.740 --> 12:36.700
<i>Though she's a commoner, 
she's quite well-off</i>

12:36.700 --> 12:39.890
<i>and has no problems with money.</i>

12:39.890 --> 12:44.680
<i>The Aurousseau Company just sent her 
to serve the minister of finance</i>

12:44.680 --> 12:47.300
<i>in order to establish 
a business connection with him.</i>

12:47.300 --> 12:48.390
<i>But...</i>

12:48.390 --> 12:49.600
I'm finished.

12:49.600 --> 12:51.660
Oh, Miss Claire...

12:51.660 --> 12:53.670
You left your peppers again.

12:53.670 --> 12:55.670
You mustn't be picky about food.

12:56.920 --> 13:01.420
<i>She seems more like 
an older sister than a maid.</i>

13:01.420 --> 13:04.930
Does it really matter? 
There are other vegetables!

13:04.930 --> 13:09.810
Miss Claire, this vegetable was 
paid for with the common folk's taxes.

13:09.810 --> 13:12.630
It's a noble's duty to eat these peppers.

13:13.070 --> 13:13.950
But...

13:13.950 --> 13:16.000
Can I eat them, then?!

13:16.000 --> 13:18.760
Yay! Miss Claire's giving me 
an indirect ki—

13:20.280 --> 13:22.110
I'm finished!

13:22.110 --> 13:23.680
Nice one, Rae!

13:23.680 --> 13:25.290
Aw, it was nothing.

13:25.290 --> 13:29.130
You were only following 
your instincts, weren't you?!

13:29.130 --> 13:33.470
Now, to tell us about the effects 
of Coulie III's policies...

13:33.470 --> 13:35.540
Miss Claire, if you please.

13:35.540 --> 13:36.660
Yes, sir.

13:41.320 --> 13:44.680
<i>As a maid, Lene doesn't 
take part in lectures.</i>

13:44.680 --> 13:47.050
<i>Since I'm also a student,</i>

13:47.050 --> 13:49.680
<i>I serve in her place when we're at school.</i>

13:50.000 --> 13:52.470
And that's how our kingdom 
increased its self-sufficiency

13:52.470 --> 13:55.690
rather than relying on imports for food.

13:55.690 --> 13:57.590
Very good answer.

14:04.820 --> 14:06.170
Hey, Rae.

14:07.220 --> 14:08.840
Prince Rod.

14:10.020 --> 14:12.830
Got time to kill? How 'bout a game?

14:12.830 --> 14:16.350
I'm sorry, but I need to 
take care of Miss Claire.

14:16.350 --> 14:17.830
That so?

14:17.830 --> 14:20.250
Guess I'll ask some other day, then.

14:20.250 --> 14:22.380
I'm up for it anytime.

14:22.380 --> 14:24.470
I told you, I have my maid work...

14:24.470 --> 14:27.220
But if Claire's with you, what's the problem?

14:29.150 --> 14:31.170
<i>This is an otome game world,</i>

14:31.170 --> 14:34.480
<i>so obviously, it has romantic elements.</i>

14:34.480 --> 14:41.230
<b>The Three Princes' Affection Levels</b>

14:34.480 --> 14:41.230
<b>Yu</b>

14:34.480 --> 14:41.230
<b>Thane</b>

14:34.480 --> 14:41.230
<b>Rod</b>

14:35.040 --> 14:37.160
<i>One of the flags for securing 
Prince Rod's route</i>

14:37.160 --> 14:40.650
<i>is to get excellent scores on the exams.</i>

14:41.230 --> 14:45.600
<i>And I knew that! That's why 
I held back in the magic tool exam!</i>

14:45.600 --> 14:47.870
<i>I guess my plan backfired...</i>

14:47.870 --> 14:50.240
Hey, Thane. How about you?

14:51.270 --> 14:55.650
<i>Prince Thane's route is the one with 
the most appearances by Miss Claire...</i>

14:56.250 --> 14:57.500
I'll pass.

14:58.660 --> 15:03.710
<i>I-I can hear the sound of Prince Thane's 
affection for me plummeting through the floor!</i>

15:03.710 --> 15:05.390
What're you crying for?

15:05.390 --> 15:07.690
<i>I want to snap his flag in half!</i>

15:10.010 --> 15:11.710
Rae!

15:12.490 --> 15:14.970
Good work. How'd the lecture go?

15:15.270 --> 15:17.030
Without incident!

15:17.580 --> 15:20.480
I didn't really do any actual work, though.

15:20.480 --> 15:23.690
Miss Claire is an excellent 
student, after all.

15:23.690 --> 15:27.250
I was hired to be her maid-plus-tutor...

15:27.250 --> 15:31.700
Don't worry. You'll be much 
busier in the afternoon.

15:31.700 --> 15:35.600
Let's give our all in service 
to Miss Claire again today!

15:35.600 --> 15:37.030
Yeah!

15:37.480 --> 15:41.960
Miss Claire, have you heard about 
the latest confection by Blume?

15:41.960 --> 15:43.510
Of course.

15:43.510 --> 15:47.060
Their new confection is 
something called "chocolate."

15:47.060 --> 15:47.970
Oh, my!

15:47.970 --> 15:51.470
Blume is the most popular 
eatery in the royal capital.

15:51.470 --> 15:54.390
And you've already sampled 
their much-awaited new item?

15:54.390 --> 15:58.450
Yes. Within its sweet taste is 
a rich aroma and a hint of bitterness.

15:58.450 --> 16:02.160
It was a truly mysterious treat 
unlike any I've had before.

16:02.640 --> 16:05.990
If you're interested, I'll have 
some sent to your room later.

16:05.990 --> 16:07.750
What? You mean it?!

16:07.750 --> 16:09.990
No fair! I want some, too!

16:12.180 --> 16:16.370
Commoner, prepare some 
chocolate for Pipi and Loretta.

16:16.370 --> 16:18.100
Certainly.

16:18.100 --> 16:19.750
Miss Claire...

16:19.970 --> 16:23.000
Are you sure it's good to keep 
someone like her at your side?

16:23.390 --> 16:25.190
I have no choice.

16:25.190 --> 16:27.490
I said I didn't want her,

16:27.490 --> 16:30.700
but Father says I must tame her.

16:30.700 --> 16:33.880
And I can't enjoy even 
a moment's rest because of it!

16:33.880 --> 16:36.410
I feel your pain!

16:36.410 --> 16:38.740
I'm talking about <i>you</i>!

16:38.740 --> 16:42.860
How lucky for you to be entrusted 
with Miss Claire's care.

16:42.860 --> 16:45.810
I bet she even gives you sweets 
out of the goodness of her heart.

16:47.310 --> 16:49.190
Don't be silly!

16:49.190 --> 16:52.430
There's no need to show 
compassion to a maid like her!

16:52.430 --> 16:55.420
That's right! I don't need sweets from her.

16:55.420 --> 16:58.700
Just one freshly worn blouse of hers 
can carry me for three meals!

17:00.160 --> 17:04.060
This is exactly what makes you so creepy!

17:04.060 --> 17:07.160
You really like Miss Claire a lot, don't you?

17:07.160 --> 17:09.050
No, I don't like her.

17:10.130 --> 17:13.360
What's this?! Did you just look 
a little bit sad, Miss Claire?!

17:13.360 --> 17:15.720
Are you getting all affectionate now?

17:15.720 --> 17:18.890
What? Affectionate?! O-Of course not!

17:18.890 --> 17:22.190
You're the one who keeps clinging 
to Miss Claire! How dare you—

17:22.190 --> 17:23.550
As I was about to say...

17:23.550 --> 17:25.650
I don't <i>like</i> her. I <i>love</i> her!

17:27.020 --> 17:28.970
In fact, I'm in love with her!

17:28.970 --> 17:29.990
Oh, dear.

17:33.110 --> 17:35.110
What grand luxury!

17:35.110 --> 17:37.990
Indeed, it is far more than 
a commoner deserves.

17:37.990 --> 17:41.180
After all, the water of this hot spring, 
drawn from the Thassal Volcano,

17:41.180 --> 17:42.750
is said to make your skin more beautiful.

17:42.750 --> 17:45.920
I truly give thanks to that volcano.

17:45.920 --> 17:48.770
Miss Claire! Rae!

17:48.770 --> 17:51.950
You'd better hurry before you catch a cold!

17:52.300 --> 17:55.840
Now, I'll take care of washing 
your body, Miss Claire.

17:55.840 --> 17:58.180
Rae, you can wash her hair.

17:58.180 --> 17:58.800
Sure!

17:58.800 --> 18:01.250
If you try anything funny, I'll slap you.

18:06.310 --> 18:07.200
Oh...

18:07.200 --> 18:08.500
You're quite good at this.

18:08.500 --> 18:10.320
Well, thank you.

18:10.760 --> 18:14.500
Your hair is so beautiful 
that it's easy to wash.

18:14.500 --> 18:17.320
It is actually naturally straight, after all.

18:17.900 --> 18:21.700
<i>Lene does Miss Claire's hair every morning.</i>

18:22.210 --> 18:27.790
<i>Her curls are actually 
inspired by her mother's hair.</i>

18:27.790 --> 18:30.310
Okay, I'll rinse it off now.

18:46.810 --> 18:48.930
That look you're giving me 
is absolutely lewd!

18:48.930 --> 18:50.230
You're imagining it.

18:50.780 --> 18:54.560
You really are very talented, Rae.

18:54.560 --> 18:57.240
I'm glad you're doing this work with me.

18:58.540 --> 19:01.910
Hmph. She'll give up and make 
a run for it soon enough.

19:01.910 --> 19:04.270
A commoner like her won't last long.

19:04.270 --> 19:06.200
Oh, come on, Miss Claire.

19:06.200 --> 19:08.370
Stop calling her a commoner. Her name is Rae.

19:08.920 --> 19:11.130
A commoner is a commoner.

19:13.700 --> 19:18.030
If you'll stop all that nonsense about 
loving me and being in love with me,

19:18.030 --> 19:19.460
I'll call you by your name.

19:19.460 --> 19:20.140
Nope.

19:20.140 --> 19:21.540
That was quick!

19:22.790 --> 19:25.390
You really are a strange girl, Rae.

19:25.810 --> 19:28.320
Didn't you only just meet Miss Claire?

19:28.320 --> 19:31.400
Yet it seems like you know 
everything about her.

19:31.400 --> 19:33.900
Well, that's because I love her!

19:33.900 --> 19:36.030
Oh, gosh!

19:39.980 --> 19:44.780
Well, Rae, I'll be heading back 
to the servants' quarters now.

19:44.780 --> 19:46.940
Okay. Goodnight.

19:55.930 --> 19:59.360
Miss Claire, did the heat make you dizzy?

19:59.360 --> 20:00.630
A bit.

20:01.700 --> 20:04.540
You did sit in a daze 
in the bath for a long time.

20:06.350 --> 20:09.180
Were my fingers that magical?

20:09.180 --> 20:10.350
Shut up!

20:11.710 --> 20:14.370
Aren't you going back to your room?

20:14.370 --> 20:17.610
I will once you fall asleep.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.830
Do you need a goodnight kiss?

20:19.830 --> 20:22.740
Do you think maids are allowed to do that?!

20:22.740 --> 20:24.950
No, I just wanted to say it.

20:26.980 --> 20:29.090
Honestly, this commoner...

20:32.940 --> 20:34.600
You're still here?

20:34.980 --> 20:35.860
Yes.

20:37.700 --> 20:38.750
I see.

20:39.970 --> 20:44.260
Why do you keep saying you love me?

20:44.260 --> 20:48.520
Because you're just so cute, 
I can't stand it.

20:49.040 --> 20:51.650
You just like my looks, then?

20:51.650 --> 20:54.420
No, I love your personality, too.

20:57.300 --> 21:00.650
Despite how I may seem, 
I think I know myself quite well.

21:01.800 --> 21:06.050
I don't have the kind of personality 
that people like.

21:06.050 --> 21:06.960
That's not—

21:06.960 --> 21:08.700
Forget the flattery.

21:09.070 --> 21:10.160
Just tell me

21:11.040 --> 21:13.170
what it is you're really after.

21:20.280 --> 21:21.670
Miss Claire...

21:22.070 --> 21:26.480
I'm here with you because I love you.

21:26.480 --> 21:28.080
No other reason.

21:30.270 --> 21:32.930
You still insist on playing innocent?

21:32.930 --> 21:35.130
You don't believe me?

21:35.130 --> 21:35.980
No.

21:38.760 --> 21:42.580
Then I'll do my best to make you believe me.

21:52.540 --> 21:54.730
Just go to bed already.

22:01.550 --> 22:04.550
Goodnight, Miss Claire.

22:13.400 --> 22:15.180
Have it your way.

23:46.820 --> 23:48.980
Miss Claire! Do you like games?

23:48.980 --> 23:50.780
Hmph! Who do you think I am?

23:50.780 --> 23:52.270
As the eldest François daughter,

23:52.270 --> 23:55.000
I know all forms of amusement 
necessary to high society!

23:55.000 --> 23:58.020
Then would you like to play 
the prince game with me?

23:58.020 --> 24:00.160
Huh?! What in the world is that?!

23:59.500 --> 24:01.000
<b>Episode 3</b>

23:59.500 --> 24:01.000
<b>My Love Is a Series of Ups and Downs</b>
